00:10:35.199 --> 00:10:36.072
you should do it.

00:10:36.072 --> 00:10:38.740
I'm cheering you on,
I'm going to support you

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.893
and I'd love to see you have the success.

00:10:40.893 --> 00:10:42.553
Some people won't you know

00:10:42.553 --> 00:10:45.590
some people will say, this
is the stupidest idea ever.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:47.340
What are you talking about?

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:48.785
Like don't go and be an entrepreneur,

00:10:48.785 --> 00:10:49.996
you're going to fail for sure.

00:10:49.996 --> 00:10:52.260
Yeah so you may not
get the result you want

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.108
but at least for me at least

00:10:54.108 --> 00:10:56.129
try, at least it there's

00:10:56.129 --> 00:10:58.525
if there's a 40% chance of it working out,

00:10:58.525 --> 00:11:00.585
at least being able to
release that demon and get

00:11:00.585 --> 00:11:02.586
their support and have them kind of

00:11:02.586 --> 00:11:04.265
cheering you on and then when you do

00:11:04.265 --> 00:11:06.599
fail because you will at some point,

00:11:06.599 --> 00:11:09.258
they have your back and
their understanding.

00:11:09.258 --> 00:11:10.912
Just in general for relationships

00:11:10.912 --> 00:11:13.995
any kind of relationship
communication is important.

00:11:13.995 --> 00:11:16.170
Instead of just playing
a surface level game

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.317
to really be vulnerable and
share the things that are

00:11:18.317 --> 00:11:20.378
on our minds is super important.

00:11:20.378 --> 00:11:22.798
So it may not work out but I definitely

00:11:22.798 --> 00:11:24.348
recommend having the conversation

00:11:24.348 --> 00:11:26.672
to at least try to get that win.

