00:11:29.773 --> 00:11:31.671
And way number seven is just to decide to

00:11:31.671 --> 00:11:33.202
live your life.

00:11:33.202 --> 00:11:34.570
Like at some point you have to decide

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.898
this is my life, if I fail it's okay.

00:11:36.898 --> 00:11:40.165
I cannot continue to live my parents life,

00:11:40.165 --> 00:11:42.877
my friends life, my cultures life

00:11:42.877 --> 00:11:44.442
because of what people
are telling me to do.

00:11:44.442 --> 00:11:46.238
When you were growing up, sure.

00:11:46.238 --> 00:11:48.011
When you're three years
old you know you're

00:11:48.011 --> 00:11:49.866
you're following your parents around you

00:11:49.866 --> 00:11:52.241
you rely on them for food and to survive.

00:11:52.241 --> 00:11:54.658
But when you're, pick an age.

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.383
16, 18,

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.182
25, 30

00:11:59.182 --> 00:12:01.629
like at some point you have to say,

00:12:01.629 --> 00:12:04.111
this is my life I'm going
to do what I want to do.

00:12:04.111 --> 00:12:05.904
And if it doesn't work out that's okay.

00:12:05.904 --> 00:12:07.242
But I'm not just going to live my life

00:12:07.242 --> 00:12:09.362
according to your expectations.

00:12:09.362 --> 00:12:12.429
You know like if you're
worried about your mom's

00:12:12.429 --> 00:12:13.797
opinion and you're 40-years-old,

00:12:13.797 --> 00:12:15.528
are you still going to
live your life by her

00:12:15.528 --> 00:12:16.361
at 50-years-old?

00:12:16.361 --> 00:12:19.557
Like how much of your life
are you going to waste

00:12:19.557 --> 00:12:22.003
living to other people's
expectations instead of

00:12:22.003 --> 00:12:23.289
living your own life.

00:12:23.289 --> 00:12:25.236
And it just comes from deciding like

00:12:25.236 --> 00:12:27.414
I am deciding that I am going to do this.

00:12:27.414 --> 00:12:28.921
It may work, it may not work.

00:12:28.921 --> 00:12:30.228
I'm doing it for me

00:12:30.228 --> 00:12:32.742
I don't care about the opinions
of the people around me.

00:12:32.742 --> 00:12:34.545
If you can't support me in me doing

00:12:34.545 --> 00:12:36.772
the thing that I want to do

00:12:36.772 --> 00:12:38.511
then that's a problem right.

00:12:38.511 --> 00:12:41.244
Then maybe you limit your access to them

00:12:41.244 --> 00:12:43.497
or at least you don't talk
about those things with them.

00:12:43.497 --> 00:12:46.431
But it doesn't prevent
you from moving forward.

00:12:46.431 --> 00:12:48.366
Other people's expectations
of you should not

00:12:48.366 --> 00:12:51.440
prevent you from playing
the game you want to play.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:53.473
Because if you're just
playing up to other people's

00:12:53.473 --> 00:12:55.713
expectations you're going to be playing

00:12:55.713 --> 00:12:57.189
small your entire life.

00:12:57.189 --> 00:12:59.328
So it's just deciding to live your life.

00:12:59.328 --> 00:13:01.414
So those are my tips on the seven ways

